      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "append = history, never loses a row   merge = current state per id   replace = whole table rewritten\nEach table is one Dagster asset of the multi-asset ticktick_tables; one run loads them together with the bookmark.\nArchiving or deleting a list sends no task change: its tasks keep their last state in tasks (compat drops tasks of deleted lists).",
      "originalText": "append = history, never loses a row   merge = current state per id   replace = whole table rewritten\nEach table is one Dagster asset of the multi-asset ticktick_tables; one run loads them together with the bookmark.\nArchiving or deleting a list sends no task change: its tasks keep their last state in tasks (compat drops tasks of deleted lists).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
